title=How+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3A+The+Complete+Beginner%27s+Roadmap+%282026%29&slug=how-to-start-warhammer-40k&content=%3Ch1%3EHow+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3A+The+Complete+Beginner%27s+Roadmap+%282026%29%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Start+Warhammer+40K+in+four+steps%3A+buy+a+starter+box+%28around+%24100%E2%80%93150%29%2C+build+and+paint+10%E2%80%9315+models+with+a+simple+scheme%2C+learn+the+core+rules+through+500-point+games%2C+then+grow+to+a+full+1%2C000-point+army.+Don%27t+plan+a+2%2C000-point+list+or+buy+a+huge+haul+on+day+one+%E2%80%94+the+hobby+rewards+small%2C+finished+steps.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Grimdark+Builds+is+an+unofficial+fan+site.+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.+We+are+not+affiliated+with+or+endorsed+by+Games+Workshop.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+1%3A+Buy+a+Starter+Box+%28Not+a+Big+Haul%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+single+biggest+beginner+mistake+is+buying+%24400+of+models+before+playing+a+single+game.+A+starter+box+gives+you+everything+in+one+purchase%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3ETwo+small+armies+%28so+you+can+play+with+a+friend+or+demo+both+sides%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EDice%2C+measuring+ruler+and+the+core+rules%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EA+clear+path%3A+assemble+%E2%86%92+paint+%E2%86%92+play%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+to+buy%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+the+current+main+starter+set+%28Space+Marines+vs.+Tyranids+or+Space+Marines+vs.+Necrons%2C+depending+on+the+edition+box+in+stores%29.+Add+side+cutters%2C+plastic+glue+and+3%E2%80%934+paint+pots+if+the+box+doesn%27t+include+them+%E2%80%94+budget+another+%2430%E2%80%9340.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%F0%9F%91%89+Not+sure+which+faction%3F+Read+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-army-for-beginners%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Army+for+Beginners%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+short+version%3A+Space+Marines+for+the+safest+start%2C+Necrons+for+the+best-looking+easy+army.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+2%3A+Build+Your+First+10%E2%80%9315+Models%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EAssembly+tips+that+save+beginners+hours+of+pain%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECut+sprues+with+side+cutters%2C+never+twist%3C%2Fstrong%3E+parts+off+%E2%80%94+twisted+plastic+leaves+marks+and+stress+lines.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDry-fit+before+gluing.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Test+that+legs%2C+torso+and+arms+line+up+before+any+glue+touches+plastic.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOne+unit+at+a+time.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Ten+finished+models+beat+fifty+half-assembled+ones+rotting+in+a+drawer.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EKeep+the+sprues.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+They+hold+small+parts+%28pouches%2C+grenades%2C+bases%29+you%27ll+want+later.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+3%3A+Paint+Them+%22Table-Ready%22+%28Not+Perfect%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBeginner+paint+formula+that+always+looks+decent%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpray+undercoat%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28black+or+grey+primer%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBasecoat%3C%2Fstrong%3E+one+main+colour+%28drybrush+or+two+thin+coats%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWash%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28a+shade+paint+like+Nuln+Oil+%E2%80%94+this+does+50%25+of+the+work+for+you%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EHighlight%3C%2Fstrong%3E+edges+lightly+with+a+lighter+colour%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETotal+time%3A+20%E2%80%9330+minutes+per+model.+A+full+500-point+army+takes+a+weekend+or+two+of+evenings.+%22Table-ready%22+%E2%80%94+not+competition-level+%E2%80%94+is+the+goal.+Your+models+will+look+better+than+you+expect+from+three+feet+away%2C+which+is+exactly+how+anyone+will+see+them+across+a+table.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+4%3A+Learn+the+Rules+With+Small+Games%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EStart+at+500+points.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Small+games+teach+movement%2C+shooting%2C+charges+and+objectives+without+overwhelming+you.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EUse+the+free+core+rules.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Games+Workshop+publishes+the+basic+rules+as+free+PDFs+%E2%80%94+you+don%27t+need+the+full+rulebook+on+day+one.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPlay+your+local+store.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Most+stores+run+beginner+nights+or+will+happily+teach+a+new+player.+Turn+up+with+painted+models+and+you%27ll+always+find+an+opponent.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELose+your+first+five+games.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+It%27s+the+standard+experience.+You%27re+learning+objectives+and+sequencing%2C+not+winning+yet.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+5%3A+Grow+to+1%2C000+Points+%28Over+Months%2C+Not+Days%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EOnce+you%27ve+played+a+handful+of+small+games%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3EExpand+the+units+you+actually+enjoyed+playing%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EAdd+one+big+centrepiece+model+%28a+tank%2C+a+Monolith%2C+a+big+hero%29+%E2%80%94+it%27s+the+fun+reward+of+the+hobby%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EAim+for+%3Cstrong%3E1%2C000+points%3C%2Fstrong%3E+as+your+first+%22real%22+army+%E2%80%94+it%27s+the+most+common+casual+game+size%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBudget+reality%3A+a+complete+1%2C000-point+army+typically+lands+around+%3Cstrong%3E%24250%E2%80%93400+all-in%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28models%2C+paint%2C+tools%29%2C+spread+over+2%E2%80%934+months.+That%27s+much+cheaper+than+most+hobbies+%E2%80%94+and+cheaper+than+buying+everything+at+once+and+quitting.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ECommon+Beginner+Mistakes+to+Avoid%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBuying+a+meta+list+off+the+internet%3C%2Fstrong%3E+before+knowing+how+you+like+to+play%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkipping+paint+to+%22get+gaming+faster%22%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+grey+plastic+armies+kill+motivation%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPlaying+only+big+games%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+you+learn+faster+in+ten+500-point+games+than+two+2%2C000-point+ones%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPerfectionism+on+the+first+models%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+your+first+squad+is+allowed+to+be+ugly.+Finish+it.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ+%E2%80%94+How+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+much+does+it+cost+to+start+Warhammer+40K%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EAround+%24130%E2%80%93190+to+start+properly%3A+a+starter+box+%28%24100%E2%80%93150%29+plus+basic+tools+and+paints+%28%2430%E2%80%9340%29.+Your+first+500-point+army+is+playable+with+nothing+else.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+Warhammer+40K+hard+to+learn%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+core+loop+%28move%2C+shoot%2C+charge%2C+fight%2C+score+objectives%29+is+learnable+in+one+evening.+Mastery+takes+months%2C+but+the+free+core+rules+plus+a+couple+of+small+games+are+enough+to+play+properly.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+I+need+the+full+rulebook+to+start%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ENo.+The+core+rules+are+free+from+Games+Workshop%2C+and+starter+boxes+include+a+trimmed-down+rules+set.+Buy+the+full+rulebook+when+you%27re+hooked%2C+not+before.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+long+until+I+can+play+a+real+game%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EOne+to+three+weekends%3A+assemble+one+box+%28an+evening+or+two%29%2C+paint+a+simple+scheme+%28a+weekend%29%2C+then+book+a+500-point+game.+Playing+unpainted+models+is+also+fully+accepted+at+stores.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShould+I+start+with+10th+edition%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+this+is+the+simplest+edition+for+beginners+in+years%2C+with+free+core+rules%2C+clean+datacards+and+an+active+beginner+scene.+There%27s+no+reason+to+wait.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECan+I+play+alone%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ECasual+solo+practice+games+work+fine+for+learning+rules%2C+and+kill-team-sized+skirmish+modes+are+popular+solo.+But+the+social+side+%E2%80%94+store+nights%2C+tournaments%2C+painting+days+%E2%80%94+is+half+the+hobby%2C+so+find+a+local+opponent+early.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EYour+First+30+Days+at+a+Glance%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EWeek%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EGoal%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E1%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBuy+starter+box+%2B+tools%2C+assemble+first+10+models%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E2%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EPaint+them+table-ready+%28basecoat+%E2%86%92+wash+%E2%86%92+highlight%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E3%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELearn+core+rules%2C+play+your+first+500-point+game%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E4%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EPaint+a+second+unit%2C+book+another+game%2C+decide+your+army%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStart+Building%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-army-for-beginners%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Army+for+Beginners%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+Space+Marines+vs.+Necrons%2C+compared%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-starter-set%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Starter+Set+in+2026+%28Compared%29%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+which+box+to+buy+first%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fspace-marines-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ESpace+Marines+Beginner+Army+Guide%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+your+first+1%2C000+points%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fnecrons-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ENecrons+Beginner+Army+Guide%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+easiest+non-Marine+start%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe+only+real+rule%3A+finish+your+first+ten+models.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Everything+else+in+this+hobby+follows+from+that.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-starter-set%2F%22%3EGet+the+starter+set+that+fits+your+army+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Chr+class%3D%22wp-block-separator+has-alpha-channel-opacity%22%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EGrimdark+Builds+is+an+unofficial+fan+site.+Warhammer+40%2C000+is+a+trademark+of+Games+Workshop.+This+site+is+not+affiliated+with+or+endorsed+by+Games+Workshop.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E&status=publish